column2:
Ah, Shambhu, in your house everything is abundant; I had known it all before.
naradapuran:78:219	All wealth and property is known by ornaments: your head is adorned by Brahma's head-garland,
naradapuran:78:220	and your chest by the garland of Naraka's (skulls); Shesha and Vasuki, poisonous, are your bracelets;
naradapuran:78:221	the quarters are your garment, matted locks your hair, ash your body-paste; the great bull your vehicle; your lineage and family unknown;
naradapuran:78:222	your parents not known; your body ill-formed-eyed. As she spoke so, Vishnu, very angry, said to Parvati:
